{
  "info": {
    "name": "Parvoz — Uzum Merchant API",
    "description": "Uzum Bank Merchant API integratsiyasi (Parvoz / Farzandim).\n\nUzum BIZGA so'rov yuboradi. Foydalanuvchi Uzum ilovasida \"Parvoz\" xizmatini topib, TELEFON RAQAMINI kiritadi va to'laydi.\n\nAuth: HTTP Basic (kollektsiya darajasida).\nSummalar: TIYINDA (1 so'm = 100 tiyin).\nHTTP kodlar: muvaffaqiyat — 200, xato — 400 (`status: FAILED` + `errorCode`).\nAuth xatosi — 401 (`errorCode: 10001`).\nStatuslar (Uzum tasdiqladi): oxirgi qayd etilgan tranzaksiya holati —\nfaqat create bo'lsa CREATED, confirm bo'lsa CONFIRMED, reverse bo'lsa REVERSED.\n\nTariflar (summa tarifni aniqlaydi):\n  • Standard oylik  — 28 000 so'm  = 2 800 000 тийин\n  • Standard yillik — 280 000 so'm = 28 000 000 тийин\n  • Premium oylik   — 45 000 so'm  = 4 500 000 тийин\n  • Premium yillik  — 450 000 so'm = 45 000 000 тийин\n\nO'zgaruvchilarni (username/password/serviceId/phone) 'Variables' bo'limida to'ldiring.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      {
        "key": "username",
        "value": "{{username}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "password",
        "value": "{{password}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://farzandimedu.uz/api/uzum/merchant",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "serviceId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "phone",
      "value": "+998900152601",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "HAQIQIY test abonenti (ro'yxatdan o'tgan ota-ona). Formatlar: +998.., 998.., 9 raqam — hammasi ishlaydi. E-mail ham qabul qilinadi."
    },
    {
      "key": "transId",
      "value": "test-trans-0001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "amount",
      "value": "2800000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "TIYINDA. 2800000 = 28 000 so'm (Standard oylik). Boshqa variantlar: 28000000 (Standard yillik), 4500000 (Premium oylik), 45000000 (Premium yillik)"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. check — to'lov imkoniyatini tekshirish",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceId\": {{serviceId}},\n  \"timestamp\": 1723363200000,\n  \"params\": {\n    \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/check",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "check"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Abonent (telefon raqami) tizimda bormi — tekshiradi.\n\nMuvaffaqiyatli javob:\n{\n  \"serviceId\": 776128,\n  \"timestamp\": 1723363200123,\n  \"status\": \"OK\",\n  \"data\": { \"account\": { \"value\": \"+998901234567\" } }\n}\n\nXato javob:\n{ \"serviceId\": 776128, \"timestamp\": ..., \"status\": \"FAILED\", \"errorCode\": 10008 }\n\nHTTP: muvaffaqiyat 200, xato 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. create — tranzaksiya yaratish",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceId\": {{serviceId}},\n  \"timestamp\": 1723363200000,\n  \"transId\": \"{{transId}}\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n  },\n  \"amount\": {{amount}}\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/create",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "create"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Tranzaksiya yaratadi (PENDING holat). Tarif SUMMA bo'yicha aniqlanadi.\n\nMuvaffaqiyatli javob:\n{\n  \"serviceId\": 776128,\n  \"timestamp\": ...,\n  \"status\": \"CREATED\",\n  \"transTime\": ...,\n  \"transId\": \"test-trans-0001\",\n  \"amount\": 2800000\n}\n\nIdempotent: bir xil transId bilan qayta yuborilsa (PENDING bo'lsa) O'SHA javob qaytadi.\n\nHTTP: muvaffaqiyat 200, xato 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. confirm — to'lovni tasdiqlash",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceId\": {{serviceId}},\n  \"timestamp\": 1723363200000,\n  \"transId\": \"{{transId}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/confirm",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "confirm"
          ]
        },
        "description": "To'lovni tasdiqlaydi va OBUNANI YOQADI.\n\nMuvaffaqiyatli javob:\n{\n  \"serviceId\": 776128,\n  \"transId\": \"test-trans-0001\",\n  \"status\": \"CONFIRMED\",\n  \"confirmTime\": ...\n}\n\nIdempotent: qayta yuborilsa obuna IKKI marta uzaytirilmaydi.\n\nHTTP: muvaffaqiyat 200, xato 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. reverse — to'lovni bekor qilish",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceId\": {{serviceId}},\n  \"timestamp\": 1723363200000,\n  \"transId\": \"{{transId}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reverse",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "reverse"
          ]
        },
        "description": "To'lovni bekor qiladi va obunani to'xtatadi.\n\nMuvaffaqiyatli javob:\n{\n  \"serviceId\": 776128,\n  \"transId\": \"test-trans-0001\",\n  \"status\": \"REVERSED\",\n  \"reverseTime\": ...,\n  \"amount\": 2800000\n}\n\nHTTP: muvaffaqiyat 200, xato 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. status — tranzaksiya holati",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceId\": {{serviceId}},\n  \"timestamp\": 1723363200000,\n  \"transId\": \"{{transId}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/status",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Tranzaksiya holatini qaytaradi.\n\nJavob:\n{ \"serviceId\": 776128, \"transId\": \"test-trans-0001\", \"status\": \"CREATED|CONFIRMED|REVERSED|FAILED\" }\n\nMoslik: pending→CREATED, success→CONFIRMED, cancelled/refunded→REVERSED\n\nHTTP: muvaffaqiyat 200, xato 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. (negativ) noto'g'ri serviceId → 400/10006",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceId\": 111111,\n  \"timestamp\": 1723363200000,\n  \"params\": {\n    \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/check",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "check"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Kutilgan javob:\n{ \"serviceId\": 111111, \"timestamp\": ..., \"status\": \"FAILED\", \"errorCode\": 10006 }\n\nHTTP: muvaffaqiyat 200, xato 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. (negativ) topilmagan abonent → 400/10008",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceId\": {{serviceId}},\n  \"timestamp\": 1723363200000,\n  \"params\": {\n    \"phone\": \"+998900000000\"\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/check",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "check"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Kutilgan javob:\n{ \"serviceId\": ..., \"timestamp\": ..., \"status\": \"FAILED\", \"errorCode\": 10008 }\n\nHTTP: muvaffaqiyat 200, xato 400."
      }
    }
  ]
}